    D["<b>1 · DATA</b><br/>Bengali regional speech (~80 hr)<br/>16 kHz · mono · TSV/WRD manifests<br/>RegSpeech12 · 12 dialects · 17,049 clips"]:::data
    P["<b>2 · PREPROCESSING</b><br/>AudioDecoder → 16 kHz resample<br/>Mono mixdown · LayerNorm<br/>No SpecAugment or augmentation"]:::prep
    T["<b>3 · TOKENIZATION</b><br/>Character-level<br/>omniASR_tokenizer_written_v2<br/>No text normalization"]:::tok
    M["<b>4 · MODEL</b><br/>Wav2Vec2 encoder<br/>(CNN frontend + Transformer, 320×↓)<br/>→ CTC head (omniASR_CTC_300M_v2, 325M params)<br/>Pretrained → fine-tuned"]:::model
    TR["<b>5 · TRAINING</b><br/>CTC loss · AdamW (β=0.9/0.98, wd=0.01)<br/>bfloat16 · length batching · grad. accum. 8<br/>Warmup 10% → Hold 40% → Decay 50%<br/>10K steps"]:::train
    DE["<b>6 · DECODING</b><br/>Greedy CTC · no language model"]:::decode
    EV["<b>7 · EVALUATION</b><br/>WER · UER (strict, test split)<br/>per-rank ref.txt / hyp.txt"]:::eval

    AN["<b>8 · ANALYSIS</b>"]:::analysis
    A1["Per-dialect WER / CER"]:::analysis
    A2["Error types<br/>(Substitution / Deletion / Insertion)"]:::analysis
    A3["Script confusion<br/>(Bengali ↔ Assamese)"]:::analysis
    A4["Vocabulary coverage"]:::analysis

    F["<b>9 · FINDINGS</b><br/>Zero-shot baseline: 97.93% WER<br/>Fine-tuned (10K steps, 80 hr): 72.97% WER"]:::findings

